{
  "dom_id": "step-32637",
  "name": "The Range of a Transformed Radical Function With an Even Index",
  "problem": "Let's now focus on the even case. What is the range of \n\n$$\ng(x) = -3\\sqrt[4]{2x-1}-2?\n$$\n\nThe range of $\\sqrt[4] x$ is\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[4] x \\ge 0.\n$$\n\nNow, let's apply transformations to the inequality above to turn the left-hand side into $g(x).$\n\nFirst, remember that horizontal shifts and stretches do not affect the range. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[4]{2x-1} \\ge 0.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $-3$ and then subtracting $2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[4]{2x-1} & \\ge 0 \\\\ -3\\sqrt[4]{2x-1} & \\le 0 \\\\ -3\\sqrt[4]{2x-1}-2 & \\le -2 \\\\ g(x) & \\le -2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the range of the given function is $g(x) \\in (-\\infty,-2].$\n\nWe can also see that this is true from the graph of the function. The graph of $y=g(x)$ is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14249143/assets/1b7f3dc07cb72ea087d7cc4ec01379efa212b89fb8ab397b6df5bccfe75e66f5.png)",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-32637\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"32637\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"5199\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-32637\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-5\">The Range of a Transformed Radical Function With an Even Index</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"32637\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n            